      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "Our Heavenly father above hallowed be thy name. \n\nWith our spirits committed
    and our fate sealed by the promise upon our lips we visit the past. The ruins
    of the earth are not only proof of your creation but of your love as it is only
    you who could cause such existence. May we perservere in the dark, without we
    would not know the presence of your light. \n"
